OL,3,GNEWSAReform trying to 'bully the       
OL,4,ALlywydd', says former presiding officer
OL,6,FReform is trying to bully the Llywydd, 
OL,7,Faccording to a former presiding        
OL,8,Fofficer.                               
OL,10,FDame Rosemary Butler made the claim as 
OL,11,Fthe main opposition party's boycott of 
OL,12,Fthe Senedd enters a second week,       
OL,13,Fcalling it "unprecedented".            
OL,15,FThe party's walkout came after Joe     
OL,16,FMartin was banned from speaking in the 
OL,17,FSenedd for remarks described by the    
OL,18,Fparliament's presiding officer Huw     
OL,19,FIrranca Davies as "unnecessarily       
OL,20,Fprovocative and deliberately           
OL,21,Foffensive".                            
